# Netlify + Cloudflare Pages redirects. Publish directory must be the
# shortxx.live/ folder itself so /ntok.css, /js/..., /creator/... resolve.
# Pretty profile URLs /@name are rewritten by functions/_middleware.js on
# Cloudflare (this /@* line below is the Netlify equivalent).
# WARNING: never add a /creator/* splat -> /creator/index.html rule:
# Cloudflare rejects it as an infinite loop (code 100324) and fails the
# ENTIRE deploy. Unknown usernames resolve via /@name (feed + grids link
# there); unknown /creator/ paths fall through to 404.html.
/saved  /saved/  301
/saved.html  /saved/  301
/discover  /discover/  200
/trending  /trending/  200
/creators  /creators/  200
/liked  /liked/  200
/saved/  /saved/index.html  200
/creator  /creator/index.html  200
/creator/  /creator/index.html  200
/@*  /creator/index.html  200

# NOTE: no per-creator slash 301s here on purpose. Every creator has a real
# static folder (tools/generate-creator-pages.mjs) so the platform adds the
# trailing slash natively. Generated /creator/<name> -> /creator/<name>/ 301s
# were removed: Cloudflare's validator rejects some as infinite loops
# (code 100324) and fails the ENTIRE deploy.
